itsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Unbolted F-9 drilling hatches. Moved F-7 hatch to F-9. Meanwhile nippled down flowline on F-7 and  prepared for lifting ball valve, spacer spool and tubing bonnet.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-04T12:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-04T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>moving -- skid</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Skidded cantilever from F-9 to F-7.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-04T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-04T14:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>moving -- skid</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed split hatches on F-7.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-04T14:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-04T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed pre-job meeting for securing F-7 flowline on XMT deck.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-04T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-04T17:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Secured flowhose with S-piece attached on XMT deck. R/U to pull tubing bonnet, spacer spool and ball valve. Vetco installed bolts for releasing lockring on tubing bonnet. Held TBT for running surface riser. Meanwhile Production Dept shut down adjacent wells according to SimOps-procedure.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-04T17:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-04T17:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Attempted to disconnect and pull tubing bonnet. Not able to pull assembly free.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-04T17:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Attempted to disconnect tubing bonnet. Adjusted lockring releasing bolts. Worked tension 0-4 ton. Not able to move bonnet. Pressured up tubing bonnet cavity to pump tubing bonnet from below. Continued adjusting releasing bolts and working tension up/down. Tubing bonnet moved up, but slightly skewed. 4-5 mm movement close to the penetrator, 5-7 mm 180 degrees off the penetrator. Continued attempting to release tubing bonnet. Attempted to wiggle assembly horizontally with chain hoists connected to spacer spool at XMT deck. Installed hydraulick jacks to prevent tubing bonnet from dropping back down.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
